        "reason": "Uses container.items.query().fetchAll() which loads all results into memory. Should use for-await-of over the query iterator instead."
      },
      {
        "name": "LRO Pattern (beginXxx + pollUntilDone)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "No long-running operations in Cosmos DB CRUD. All operations (create, read, query, replace, delete) are immediate. Criterion not applicable."
      },
      {
        "name": "RestError Exception Handling",
